{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the digits of the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/1/bb1d3c50c047c9657f537a3de341f0f97b8671c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{2006}-2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/494105c479895e3030d15fef6e0a332511d0ff51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 18006\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 20060\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 2006\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 18047\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"568\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/5389076c4616fb23f36b4d4059d98462c84c7fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> followed by 2006 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s. When we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />, we will get something close to 2006 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s.\n</p><p>The last four digits are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1bb65e2fbed2a3d9614ab40748cfcd74342499d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10000 - 2006 = 7994$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"164\" height=\"13\" />, and so we have 2002 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s followed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/7/c370aad23efb52c891db899c37ebb5cf45405a9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7994$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of these is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a517c8d62a25889fcdd0586cde80ca02b4ed488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002 \\cdot 9 + 7 + 9 + 9 + 4 = 18047 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"319\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/